WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
Here is a bag of sweets.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.850
One sweet is red.

3
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.790
Nine sweets are green.

4
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.090
You shut your eyes and pull one out.

5
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.890
It will be red, or it will be green.

6
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.410
Two things can happen.

7
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.550
So is your chance of red fifty-fifty?

8
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.230
In this mission, you'll
describe chances in words,

9
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.810
like unlikely and even chance,

10
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.790
and place them on a
scale from zero to one.

11
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.410
You'll work out a probability
when every outcome is equally

12
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:27.870
likely.

13
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.370
And you'll see why all the
probabilities must add up to one.

14
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:37.210
Your mission: decide when two
outcomes really are fifty-fifty.
